Usage of retire:
  -reason string
    	why the run is retired (required, 1-160 characters)
  -session-registry string
    	absolute session registry path (same as apply/resume; default ./.irrigator/current-session.json)
  -superseded-by string
    	optional registered, non-retired run that replaces this one
  -superseded_by string
    	alias of --superseded-by
